    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that helps a lot. one thing though... some people would say that even if there's bias, these tests are still the most objective way we have to measure potential, and that rejecting them basically just throws away any way to identify talent fairly. how would a researcher respond to that claim that the alternative is just subjective guesswork?",
